Name: Indic NLP Library
Short Name: indicnlp
URL: https://github.com/VarunGumma/indic_nlp_library
Version: 0.1.1 (indic-nlp-library-itt)
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
Anoop Kunchukuttan's Indic NLP Library: normalisation of Indian scripts,
conversion between them and simple tokenising, as IndicTrans2 uses them.

Local Modifications:
The steps caption text reaches (the Devanagari, Tamil and Bengali
normalisers, the Unicode-block script converter, the trivial tokeniser and
detokeniser) ported to C++ in components/tark_captions/indic_text.cc. No
Python is shipped.
